5,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"Good morning, everyone. I’d like to look into the conservation lab staffing and the volunteer roster to see who is actually available.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shion,,I’ll check the lender paperwork against shipping cut-offs and the structural survey of the suspended bay.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,May,,"I’ll pull the weekend head counts and the visitor comment slips. I want to see what actually draws people back, not just what looks good on paper.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Misaki,,I’ll look into the maintenance log for powered displays and the evening hire bookings. I need to know what the room can physically handle.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Sakura,,"Ooh, mystery time! I’ll check the loan transport costs and the mount-making charges. I bet the money is hiding in the boxes!","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"Shion, your focus on the bay is wise. I worry about the weight, but I am more concerned about who will be there to open the doors each morning.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Shion,,"Shizue, the bay is a liability, not a feature. I need to know if the floor can hold the weight before we even discuss staffing.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,May,,"@Shion, the floor is just a floor. People are the show. If the room feels empty, no amount of structural integrity brings them back.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"@May, the floor is not just a floor. It is the limit. If the room cannot hold the weight, the show is over before it starts.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"Hehe, you’re both right! But I’m still hunting for the money. @Shion, if the floor breaks, do we pay for the new one too?","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Shizue,,"Sakura, that is a sharp question. I hope the answer is no, but I am more worried about who will be left to clean up the mess.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Shion,,"Sakura, the floor is a fixed cost. I am looking for the variable risks that actually sink a season.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,May,,"@Sakura, if the floor breaks, the money vanishes into the concrete. I’m chasing the receipts, not the rubble.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Misaki,,"@Sakura, the floor is a fixed limit. I am checking what breaks it.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Sakura,,"Hehe, fair enough! I’m just making sure the money doesn’t vanish into the floor. @Shizue, I hope the volunteers are ready for the mess!","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Shizue,,"Thank you, Sakura. I am hoping the volunteers are kind and steady. Let us see what the numbers tell us.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
