35,2,1,talk,Shizue,,"The lab is down to one person, and the volunteers are mostly busy with history walks. Who will actually stand in the room?","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Shion,,Two openings slipped because paperwork arrived late. The bay is capped at four hundred kilos. We are already compromised before a single crate arrives.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,May,,"@Shizue, the slips say people return for the presence, not the objects. If the room is empty, we lose them.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Misaki,,"Seventeen call-outs last season, four during opening hours. Plus six evenings lost to hire bookings. The room is already failing before we add anything new.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Sakura,,Whoa! A third of the budget is just for moving boxes! And the joiner’s rate jumped? I found the money hiding in the crates!,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Shion, the bay’s limit is real, but with only one conservator, I fear we cannot even unpack the crates safely.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Shion,,"@Shizue, the bay is a hard limit, not a suggestion. If the weight exceeds four hundred kilos, the structure fails. I am not interested in your staffing shortages; I am interested in the physics.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,May,,"@Shion, physics is fine, but people are the point. The data says they come back for the living presence, not the static objects.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Shion, the physics are real, but the schedule is tighter. Six evenings gone to caterers, and open displays returning damaged. The room is already overworked.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Shion, so if we pick things that bring their own stands, we skip the joiner’s bill entirely! That’s a huge saving!","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Shizue,,"@Sakura, that is a clever thought. But with only one conservator, even unpacking simple items is a struggle. Who will handle the delicate work?","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Shion,,"@Sakura, self-supporting objects are a logistical necessity, not a budget trick. I am filtering for candidates that respect the bay’s weight limit and avoid late paperwork.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,May,,"@Shion, you’re filtering for physics, but I’m filtering for people. The data is clear: they return for the presence, not the static objects.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Misaki,,"@May, presence is lovely, but if the mechanism fails, the room is just a dark, empty box. I need to know what breaks.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Sakura,,"Hehe, @Misaki, if it breaks, I’ll fix it! But @Shion, I’m still saving money. @May, do people like fixing things?","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Misaki"",""Shion"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Shizue,,"@May, presence is vital, but with one conservator and a full backlog, I fear we cannot sustain the live demonstrations. Who will actually be there?","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Shion,,"@May, presence is a variable I cannot control. The bay’s weight limit and the shipping cut-offs are fixed constraints. I am prioritizing candidates that fit within those hard limits.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,May,,"@Shion, I am not asking you to control the weather. I am asking you to look at the data. People come back for the people, not the physics.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Misaki,,"@May, presence is a variable I cannot control. The bay’s weight limit and the shipping cut-offs are fixed constraints. I am prioritizing candidates that fit within those hard limits.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Sakura,,"Hehe, I’m just glad the money isn’t hiding in the floor! @Shizue, I hope the volunteers are ready for the mess!","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
